{
  "id": "product.wow-bento",
  "kind": "section",
  "name": "Wow bento card grid",
  "purpose": "Lays out a set of concrete use-cases, release items or inclusions as image-led cards under a heading, often with a supporting customer quote.",
  "category": "product",
  "designSystem": "marketing",
  "implementedBy": "src/components/sections/WowBento.jsx",
  "description": "One component with a `variant` prop whose variants have genuinely different shapes. cards (/lms/small-business, 1st): split header (H2 left, small italic side quote right), a 1.5fr/1fr row (rect + square media) then three squares, each with a caption whose lead-in is white, and a centred demo button. cards-cta (/lms/small-business, 2nd): serif H3 + paragraph beside a side quote, then two rect 'Team photo' cards with a serif H4, text and a small dark button each. release (/lms/spring-release): H2 | paragraph + green pill button, then three rows of two feature cards (one per row is 150% wide). included (/mentoring): centred H2 and three feature cards with a 20px title and text. why (/company/why-nimbus): H2 + paragraph + dark button beside a quote card, two square photos (event, team) with a caption, an awards line with four award shields, and a closing large quote. All stack at <=991/767.",
